                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Take ‘ōki’ literally: a donburi piled impossibly high, with chopsticks planted in it. A blocky Dela Gothic wordmark with a single 大 seal. The loudest and most playful of the three.",
